      "date": "2026-10-13 14:43:46.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 3:\n\n(3 comments)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nSome concerns, see inline comments. The batching itself is correct (every batch is at most 100, and the per-round total is unchanged), but the commit message's explanation of where the split is triggered doesn't match the MDT code. If that's right, the patch won't add the MDS traces it is meant to capture.",
