        },
        "committer": {
          "name": "Lai Siyao",
          "email": "lai.siyao@whamcloud.com",
          "date": "2026-10-12 04:05:27.000000000",
          "tz": 0
        },
        "subject": "LU-20840 test: keep full debug during creates in test_230q",
        "message": "LU-20840 test: keep full debug during creates in test_230q\n\ncreatemany() sets debug=ha on all nodes when count > 100 to speed\nup bulk creates. In test_230q this blinds the MDS debug logs\nexactly when the directory auto-split triggers: the split-threshold\ncheck runs inside mdt_reint_create() during the creates, and the\nstriper thread works while the subsequent wait_update() polls with\nfull debug restored. When the split does not complete in time (the\nlong-standing LU-15844 \"stripe count 0 != 2\" failure), the dumped\nlctl dk logs contain no MDS traces and the failure cannot be\ndiagnosed.\n\nCreate in batches of at most 100 so createmany() never switches\nthe debug mask, while still adding the same number of entries per\nsplit round. Test semantics are unchanged: same thresholds crossed,\nsame totals, same imbalance margins.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity mdscount=4 mdtcount=4 env=ONLY=230q,ONLY_REPEAT=10\nSigned-off-by: Lai Siyao <lai.siyao@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I4e8b665696d247159bc8eca5484f30a3ca13c7fc\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master",
      "description": "Rebase"
    }
